  "description": "A first love stained by rumors and misunderstandings came to an end, leaving deep wounds on both of them. To bury the pain, Seulha closed off her heart and withdrew into a quiet life, cut off from the world. Ten years passed that way. Just as she had begun to feel content with a monotonous but peaceful existence, Jang Doseok, her first love from ten years ago, reappears before her as if by fate. Inevitably drawn back into the ties of the past, Seulha begins to face, one by one, the thorns that had remained lodged deep in her heart for all those years. Like new skin forming over a healed wound, their love slowly begins to bloom once again. But after a love that was as dazzling as it was painful… is it truly okay to start over?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=852164), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14333883)",
